    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Cafe</strong> is a casual game where you can play games like <strong>Spades</strong>, <strong>Okey</strong>, <strong>Backgammon</strong> and more with your friends or other cross platform players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We bring the traditional <strong>Game Cafe</strong> culture to online platform. Take a seat, order a tea and enjoy playing games with your friends while sipping it. If you don't want to waste your tokens then play well, win and make others pay the bill.</p>",
